<title>JAPAN: Toyo Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.64		vs	   11.27</p>
<p> Operating	  780    million    vs	  648    million</p>
<p> Current	    470    million    vs	  464    million</p>
<p> Net		  173    million    vs	  112    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.10 yen	  vs	    3.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     35 million	  vs	  31 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Chemical Co Ltd is a comprehensive resin processor focusing on PVC resins.</p>
</text>
